                "retweet_count": 37,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "My Office works tirelessly to get results for YOU. \n\nWe\u2019ve resolved 1,661 cases, that means families reunited, Social Security checks delivered, veterans\u2019 benefits unlocked, and much more.\n\nWhether it\u2019s the IRS, immigration, Medicare, or any other Washington red tape, my team fights to cut through the bureaucracy for you.\n\nYour fight is my fight \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8\n\n\ud83d\udcde (305) 668-2285\n\ud83d\udcbb https://t.co/I1uSGUBZlz",
