                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Such an amazing morning meeting the residents of Robert King Tower Comedor in my district. \n\nI love meeting the seniors in our community, the seasoned souls who built Miami!\n\nI\u2019ll keep fighting for them, from securing funding for affordable senior housing to ensuring Medicare runs smoothly.\n\nTheir legacy is Miami\u2019s strength.",
