                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The House is back! Finally\n\nMy FIRST priority now is ensuring Americans can get the healthcare and benefits they need.\n\nThat\u2019s why I\u2019m co-sponsoring the Bipartisan Premium Tax Credit Extension Act, which extends healthcare subsidies and ensures people who like their plans can keep affording them.",
