                "retweet_count": 85,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I signed a letter urging Senate leaders to include both parties in their legislative process to reform healthcare, so we can ensure patients come before politics and get the results we need. \n\nPremiums are skyrocketing and millions could lose their coverage if we don\u2019t act. That\u2019s why I\u2019m in favor of extending ACA subsidies and making sure families\u2019 health comes first, always!",
