                "reply_count": 18,
                "retweet_count": 21,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "When it comes to ensuring you can keep your healthcare and supporting the Affordable Care Act, my record is crystal clear: \n\n1\ufe0f\u20e3 Original sponsor on bill to extend ACA subsidies (H.R. 5145)\n\n2\ufe0f\u20e3 Have endorsed ALL measures to keep healthcare affordable \n\n3\ufe0f\u20e3JUST sent a letter to Senate Leaders to make sure the House is at the table so we can find a solution together. \n\nI KNOW premiums are rising and I\u2019m actively working with colleagues to find a solution together to avoid increases and make sure everyone can access the care they need!",
