                "reply_count": 20,
                "retweet_count": 36,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "This morning, I proudly stood with my congressional colleagues to protect affordable healthcare.\n\nIn my district, +230k people rely on ACA credits and losing them would be devastating for families here at home and for millions more across the country who face the same threat.\n\nAmerica is the land of opportunity, but that promise means nothing if you can\u2019t afford to see a doctor or risk financial ruin from a medical emergency.\n\nThat\u2019s why I\u2019m supporting this bipartisan framework. It would keep healthcare affordable and moves us toward a system that finally works for everyone.",
